Use the selected PAR2 filename for the repair wildcard. A second set with
the same prefix is keyed by its set ID, which need not appear on disk.
Keep the wider search when it could recover an unclaimed file.

Related upstream work: develop filters other sets' targets in its
in-process repairer (https://github.com/sabnzbd/sabnzbd/commit/a5d99d10294f465017c7a45d126a4e6e160eb23f).

